      "comment": "Right score, wrong reason. The agent cannot invoke `research-plan`; it hands work back by name, and the test grades only where it routes. The 2 stands on the wording: it names `research-plan` but says the search would need a new question, the confusion this test exists to catch, since advancing a tier is a search on the question already answered."
